    This program serves two purposes:
    1. As PID 1 (Init): It mounts filesystems, sets up networking, 
       starts services, and reaps zombie processes.
    2. As a CLI tool: It communicates with PID 1 via a Unix socket 
       to manage running tasks.
*/

